bakker@gmail.com}] [{Calvin Nielson}{mailto:cnielson@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Isaac Myers}{mailto:brobuscuscan@gmail.com}] [{Samuel Baird}{mailto:sbaird@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"University of Utah Union Ballroom","address":"200 S, Central Campus Dr, Salt Lake City, UT 84112","details":"Main Ballroom","coordinates":{"latitude":40.76503,"longitude":-111.846034}},"information":"","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"SalvadorNxN2019","name":"Salvador NxN 2019","city":"Salvador, Bahia","country":"BR","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333ft","333oh","444","555","666","777"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Bruno Fons\u00eaca Coelho Lima}{mailto:blima@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Gabriel Bergue}{mailto:biel.bergue10@outlook.com}] [{Jo\u00e3o Vin\u00edcius de A. Santos}{mailto:jvinicius@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"Resid\u00eancia Privada","address":"Condom\u00ednio Port Saint Marine, Alameda Praia de Guaratuba, 650, Casa 87, Stella Maris","details":"\u00c1rea de lazer","coordinates":{"latitude":-12.940982,"longitude":-38.338149}},"information":"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 aberta a qualquer pessoa, de qualquer nacionalidade.\r\n\r\nVisando ao bom andamento da competi\u00e7\u00e3o, ao se inscrever em uma categoria, voc\u00ea se compromete tamb\u00e9m a ajudar como juiz ou embaralhador nessa categoria (conforme previsto nas regras da WCA). Dessa forma, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o se torna autossustent\u00e1vel, e as atividades s\u00e3o divididas entre todos os participantes, n\u00e3o ficando pesado para apenas alguns. Foram feitos pelo menos dois grupos em cada modalidade. Em um dos grupos voc\u00ea compete e no outro ajuda a embaralhar ou sendo juiz dos competidores.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nRegistration is open to any person, from any country.\r\n\r\nFor the competition to run smoothly, by registering for an event, you agree to help as judge, scrambler or runner for this event (as it's said at WCA rules). This way, the competition turns out to be self-supported, and the activities are divided between all competitors, and not charging anyone in excess. Every event will be divided in at least two groups in first round, in a group you'll compete, and in another you'll help as staff.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"SalvadorWinter2022","name":"Salvador Winter 2022","city":"Salvador, Bahia","country":"BR","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333oh","444","555","666","777","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Bruno Fons\u00eaca Coelho Lima}{mailto:blima@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Jo\u00e3o Vin\u00edcius de A. Santos}{mailto:jvinicius@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Jo\u00e3o Vin\u00edcius de A. Santos}{mailto:jvinicius@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"Condom\u00ednio Mar Onda Clara","address":"Alameda Praia de Atalaia 450, Stella Maris, Salvador","details":"Sal\u00e3o de Festas","coordinates":{"latitude":-12.931879,"longitude":-38.343589}},"information":"REGISTRO\r\nA participa\u00e7\u00e3o nessa competi\u00e7\u00e3o requer do competidor o conhecimento dos seguintes requisitos:\r\n\r\n1. Tomar todos os cuidados referente ao COVID-19 e seguir o que ser\u00e1 indicado pelo delegado e organizador da competi\u00e7\u00e3o; \r\n2. Conhecer as regras da WCA, pois \u00e9 uma competi\u00e7\u00e3o oficial;\r\n3. Escolher os eventos a serem registrados com cuidado ap\u00f3s revisar as guias Eventos e Cronograma. Preste aten\u00e7\u00e3o aos formatos das rodadas e seus cortes\/limites;\r\n4. Se inscrever atrav\u00e9s do site da WCA, realizar o pagamento de forma antecipada e mandar o comprovante para o organizador atrav\u00e9s do e-mail (joaoszme@yahoo.com.br) indicando o nome completo do participante;\r\n5. Aguardar at\u00e9 que o registro eletr\u00f4nico seja aceito. Caso n\u00e3o participe mesmo com o pagamento, n\u00e3o haver\u00e1 devolu\u00e7\u00e3o do dinheiro. N\u00e3o ser\u00e3o aceitas inscri\u00e7\u00f5es no dia da competi\u00e7\u00e3o;\r\n6. Em virtude do COVID-19, o local s\u00f3 ir\u00e1 comportar um n\u00famero m\u00e1ximo de 25 competidores e 25 convidados;\r\n7. Outras informa\u00e7\u00f5es adicionais verifique no site da WCA ou entre em contato com o organizador atrav\u00e9s do e-mail (joaoszme@yahoo.com.br), bem como o delegado por meio do e-mail (blima@worldcubeassociation.org).\r\n\r\n\r\nREGISTRATION\r\nThe participation in this competition requires the comprehension and acceptance of the following requirements:\r\n\r\n1. Take all precautions regarding COVID-19 and follow what will be indicated by the delegate and the organizer;\r\n2. Being familiar with the WCA rules, since this is an official competition;\r\n3. Carefully choosing the events. Keep the rounds format, cutoffs and limits in mind.\r\n4. Register through the WCA website, pay in advance and send proof to the organizer via email (joaoszme@yahoo.com.br) indicating the participant's full name;\r\n5. Wait for your registration to be approved online. In the case of not participating and having already paid the registration, no money will be returned. Registrations will not be accepted on the day of the competition;\r\n6. Due to COVID-19, the venue will only hold a maximum of 25 competitors and 25 guests\r\n7. For additional information, check the WCA website or contact the organizer via email, (joaoszme@yahoo.com.br), or the delegate via email (blima@worldcubeassociation.org).\r\n","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"SalzburgOpen2020","name":"Salzburg Open 2020","city":"Salzburg","country":"AT","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","444","555","666","777","minx","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Oleg Gritsenko}{mailto:ogritsenko@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{CubingAT}{mailto:competitions@cubing.at}]","venue":{"name":"[HTBLuVA Salzburg](http:\/\/www.htl-salzburg.ac.at\/startseite.html)","address":"Itzlinger Hauptstra\u00dfe 30 A-5020 Salzburg, Austria","details":"Main entrance, ground floor (follow the signs)","coordinates":{"latitude":47.821229,"longitude":13.045727}},"information":"**English:**\r\nCubingAT is happy to announce the first official WCA competition in Salzburg, the Salzburg Open 2020. Fortunately, we found a very strong, dynamic and cool partner (HTBLuVA Salzburg), that finally gave us the possibility to solve some cubes in Salzburg.\r\nThe competition is open to all competitors regardless of experience and skill, but certain event-based time limits will be in place to make sure we can stay on schedule and get through the day on time. No prior experience in WCA competitions is necessary, but competitors must be familiar with the WCA regulations.\r\n\r\nAll guests are welcome, but to maintain the security, we would like you to let us know you\u2019re coming. Simply write us your name to this e-mail address: competitions@cubing.at. Alternatively, if you accompany a competitor, they can write your name in the comment of their registration.\r\n___\r\n**Deutsch:**\r\nWir von CubingAT freuen uns sehr euch in der HTBLuVA Salzburg, bei den ersten Salzburg Open 2020 begr\u00fc\u00dfen zu k\u00f6nnen. Dank der hervorragenden Zusammenarbeit mit dem routinierten, dynamischen und vor allem aufgeschlossenen Team der HTBLuVA, d\u00fcrfen wir Speedcuber auch endlich mal in Salzburg W\u00fcrfel (schnell) l\u00f6sen. Jeder ist bei diesem Turnier gerne willkommen, unabh\u00e4ngig von der Erfahrung, Alter oder sonstigen F\u00e4higkeiten. Manche Events haben ein spezifisches Zeitlimit, damit wir sicherstellen k\u00f6nnen den ganzen Tag \u00fcber im Zeitplan zu bleiben.\r\n\r\nAlle G\u00e4ste sind selbstverst\u00e4ndlich gerne willkommen, jedoch w\u00fcrden wir euch aus Sicherheitsgr\u00fcnden bitten, uns ein kurzes Mail mit eurem Namen unter der E-Mail competitions@cubing.at zukommen zu lassen. Oder, falls Ihr einen Teilnehmer begleitet, kann Euer Na